# Component Architecture

- Every React component/page/layout must live in its **own folder** named after the component (PascalCase).
- Each folder must contain exactly:
  - `index.tsx` (main component)
  - `style.css` (component styles)
  - `consts.ts` (constants/config/mock data for that component)
- Do not place multiple components in the same folder.
- Prefer small, reusable components.
- No hardcoded UI strings inside components when they can live in `consts.ts`.

